<p><a href="index.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navtop.png"/></a> <a href="index.html">Contents</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="oracleprotologinattempts.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navprev.png"/></a> <a href="oracleprotologinattempts.html">Oracle Login Attempts</a> | <a href="oracleprotocol.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navtop.png"/></a> <a href="oracleprotocol.html">Oracle Protocol</a> | <a href="oracleprotoverifiertype.html">Oracle Password Verifier Type</a> <a href="oracleprotoverifiertype.html"><img style="vertical-align: middle; " src="../../images/navnext.png"/></a></p>

<a name="oracleserverversion"/><h1>Server Version</h1>

<p>The <i>serverversion</i> option sets which Oracle version the Oracle protocol module imitates: 11.2 or 12.1.  It defaults to 12.1, and any other value is the same as leaving it out.  It also sets the default <a href="oracleprotoverifiertype.html">Password Verifier Type</a>.  Some clients only support some protocol versions.  To support clients that need different versions, add a listener tag for each <i>serverversion</i>.</p>

<blockquote>
<!-- Generator: GNU source-highlight 3.1.9
by Lorenzo Bettini
http://www.lorenzobettini.it
http://www.gnu.org/software/src-highlite -->
<pre><tt><b><font color="#000080">&lt;?xml</font></b> <font color="#009900">version</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"1.0"</font><b><font color="#000080">?&gt;</font></b>
<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;instances&gt;</font></b>
	<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;instance</font></b> <font color="#009900">id</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"example"</font> <font color="#009900">dbase</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"oracle"</font><b><font color="#0000FF">&gt;</font></b>
		<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;listeners&gt;</font></b>
			<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;listener</font></b> <font color="#009900">protocol</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"oracle"</font> <font color="#009900">port</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"1521"</font> <font color="#009900">serverversion</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"11.2"</font><b><font color="#0000FF">/&gt;</font></b>
		<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;/listeners&gt;</font></b>
		<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;connections&gt;</font></b>
			<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;connection</font></b> <font color="#009900">string</font><font color="#990000">=</font><font color="#FF0000">"user=scott;password=tiger;oracle_home=/u01/app/oracle/product/12.1.0;oracle_sid=ora1"</font><b><font color="#0000FF">/&gt;</font></b>
		<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;/connections&gt;</font></b>
	<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;/instance&gt;</font></b>
<b><font color="#0000FF">&lt;/instances&gt;</font></b>
</tt></pre>

</blockquote>
